id: cs_dust2
name: Dust II
description: Dust II. Footprint traced from the published radar, then annotated by hand with the callouts, elevations, ramps and cover the radar cannot carry. A topology reconstruction - proportions are approximate and no assets from the shipped game are used.
grid: 1.42
wall_thickness: 0.36

